---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const species = [
  { name: "Alder", file: "Alder" },
  { name: "Butternut", file: "Butternut" },
  { name: "Cherry", file: "Cherry" },
  { name: "English Sycamore", file: "English-Sycamore" },
  { name: "Hickory", file: "Hickory" },
  { name: "Lyptus", file: "Lyptus" },
  { name: "Mahogany", file: "Mahogany" },
  { name: "Maple", file: "Maple" },
  { name: "Oak", file: "Oak" },
  { name: "Paint-Grade Maple", file: "Paint-Grade-Maple" },
  { name: "Walnut", file: "Walnut" },
  { name: "Wenge", file: "Wenge" },
  { name: "White Birch", file: "White-Birch" },
  { name: "Wormy Chestnut", file: "Wormy-Chestnut" },
  { name: "Zebrawood", file: "ZebraWood" }
].map(s => ({
  ...s,
  src: `https://snitzcreek.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/${s.file}.jpg`
}));

const styleImages = [
  "Doors-9906-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9914-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9918-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9922-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9934-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9942-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9952-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9963-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9969-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9975-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9977-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9983-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9988-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9994-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9995-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-9997-scaled-400x400-1",
  "Doors-scaled-400x400-1"
].map(name => ({
  src: `https://snitzcreek.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/${name}.jpg`,
  title: name.replace(/-scaled-400x400-1$/, "").replace(/-/g, " ")
}));

const finishImages = [
  "2-2", "3-1", "4-1", "5-1", "6-1", "7-1", "8-1", "9-1", "10-1", "11-1", "12-1", "13-1"
].map(name => `https://snitzcreek.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/${name}.jpg`);
---

<Layout title="Cabinetry | Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-24">
    <section class="py-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-wood text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Cabinetry</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl text-darkwood mb-6">Custom Cabinetry Since 1967</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-charcoal/70">Framed and frameless styles, built to suit your home. Our designers guide you through every choice of style, species, finish, and hardware.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Door Styles -->
    <section class="py-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-8 text-center">Door Styles</h2>
      <p class="text-center text-charcoal/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">A sampling of our door styles. We offer framed and frameless construction and will custom build to suit your needs.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
        {styleImages.map(img => (
          <div class="group">
            <div class="aspect-[3/4] bg-cream overflow-hidden rounded mb-3 flex items-center justify-center">
              <img src={img.src} alt={img.title} class="max-w-full max-h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-700" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-sm text-darkwood text-center">{img.title}</h3>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Species -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-cream">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-8 text-center">Wood Species</h2>
        <p class="text-center text-charcoal/70 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Choose from a wide selection of solid woods. Each species brings its own character, grain, and durability. Samples are available in the showroom.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
          {species.map(s => (
            <div class="group">
              <div class="aspect-[3/4] bg-white overflow-hidden rounded mb-3 flex items-center justify-center border border-wood/10">
                <img src={s.src} alt={s.name} class="max-w-full max-h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-700" />
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-sm text-darkwood text-center">{s.name}</h3>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Finishes -->
    <section class="py-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-6 text-center">Finishes</h2>
      <p class="text-center text-charcoal/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">We have included several of our many options for cabinet finishes. There are almost no finishes we cannot do! If you have a favorite paint color, we can color match it!</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        {finishImages.map((src, i) => (
          <div class="group">
            <div class="aspect-square bg-cream overflow-hidden rounded flex items-center justify-center">
              <img src={src} alt={`Finish sample ${i + 1}`} class="max-w-full max-h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-700" />
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Decorative Hardware -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-6 text-center">Decorative Hardware</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>The right hardware completes the look. We offer industry-leading brands of pulls, knobs, and decorative hardware to elevate the style of your cabinetry.</p>
          <p>Our team helps you navigate the options so the hardware complements your design — whether traditional, modern, or transitional.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Warranty -->
    <section class="py-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-6 text-center">Warranty</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <p><strong>The Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop proudly warrants its custom kitchen cabinetry to be free from defects in materials and workmanship to the original owner for the lifetime of the warranty.</strong></p>
        <p>This warranty covers the craftsmanship of the cabinet boxes, doors and functional hardware. Natural aging or darkening of wood color, variation in wood and grains, normal wear and tear are typical in solid wood, and are not considered defects. Over time gaps may develop in door joints from temperature and humidity changes, these gaps are not subject to repair or replacement as they are a normal part of the aging process. This warranty does not include damage due to misuse, abuse, improper storage, or exposure to extreme temperatures or humidity.</p>
        <p>Please note that the Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop continuously strives to provide the best quality products to its customers and therefore, due to progress and possibly other circumstances outside its control, identical replacement parts may not be available. Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop cannot be held liable in the case that the replacement parts are different than parts originally supplied at the time of purchase. As time progresses, natural and environmental elements will alter the appearance of wood products; Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop will make its best efforts to match the appearance of the original products, but cannot be held responsible if the color match is not perfect.</p>
        <p>Should a defect in the material or workmanship arise during the warranty period, Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop reserves the right use its judgment to either repair or replace the defective part(s). This warranty includes only the parts and materials which were supplied by Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop, and does not cover costs for removal or reinstallation of countertops, plumbing fixtures, appliances or labor costs.</p>
        <p>To submit a warranty claim, please contact the Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop at:</p>
        <p>2020 Cornwall Rd., Lebanon, PA 17042<br />Ph: <a href="tel:7172739861" class="text-wood hover:text-darkwood">(717) 273-9861</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 bg-darkwood text-cream text-center">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Ready to design your cabinetry?</h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block mt-6 bg-gold text-charcoal px-10 py-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-medium hover:bg-cream transition">Start a Project</a>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
